      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Travelers</b> are characters that stop by <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a>'s shop to ask for potions.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Types_of_travelers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Types of travelers</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Normal_Quest_travelers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Normal Quest travelers</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Requests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Requests</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Challenge_Quest_travelers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Challenge Quest travelers</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Level_of_Travelers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Level of Travelers</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#List_of_travelers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">List of travelers</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Types_of_travelers\">Types of travelers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTravelers%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are two main types of travelers. However, these categories are not mutually exclusive and more than one can apply to a single traveler.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Normal_Quest_travelers\">Normal Quest travelers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTravelers%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"notice-template\" style=\"text-align:center;background:#fff7f7;width:100%;margin-left:2%;padding:0 1em;border:1px solid #b77;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p>The title of this section is <i><b>conjectural</b></i>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>These travelers are travelers that issue normal quests. When completed, they give the respective unique <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup\" title=\"Powerup\">powerups</a> of the traveler that aid the creation of <a href=\"/wiki/Potion\" title=\"Potion\">potions</a>.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requests\">Requests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTravelers%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>These travelers can be asked to perform a <b>request</b>, which have various chances of failure or success. Requests success rates are dependent on the level of the traveler, which the exception of some <a href=\"/wiki/Event\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Event\">event</a> requests, which have constant success rates. When a request is issue, the current quest is cancelled and the traveler starts working on the request.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Challenge_Quest_travelers\">Challenge Quest travelers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTravelers%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"notice-template\" style=\"text-align:center;background:#fff7f7;width:100%;margin-left:2%;padding:0 1em;border:1px solid #b77;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p>The title of this section is <i><b>conjectural</b></i>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>These travelers are travelers that issue a challenge request. Challenge quests have a longer preparation phrase than normal quests, granting more time for tasks considered more difficult. Challenge quests do not grant powerups upon completion, instead granting <a href=\"/wiki/Likeability\" title=\"Likeability\">likeability</a>. During a challenge quest, <a href=\"#Requests\">requests</a> cannot be issued.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Level_of_Travelers\">Level of Travelers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTravelers%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All normal quest travelers have their of level. They can be level up by complete the normal quests, each normal quests will give certain amount of experience. To get 100% success rate of requests, the level of traveler must at least same as the level of request.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Level\n</th>\n<th>Experience required\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>Starting level\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>300\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5\n</td>\n<td>1500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td>3000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>5000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8\n</td>\n<td>7500\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td>10000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>15000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td>30000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>50000\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_travelers\">List of travelers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTravelers%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"navtemplate\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#660099\" colspan=\"2\">Characters\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"65px\" style=\"background:#ddd\">Protagonists\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\">Tia</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"65px\" style=\"background:#ddd\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Travelers</strong>\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tirami\" title=\"Tirami\">Tirami</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Neet\" title=\"Neet\">Neet</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Luke\" title=\"Luke\">Luke</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Claire\" title=\"Claire\">Claire</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Dolbur\" title=\"Dolbur\">Dolbur</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Piria\" title=\"Piria\">Piria</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Demian\" title=\"Demian\">Demian</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte\" title=\"Charlotte\">Charlotte</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Daisy\" title=\"Daisy\">Daisy</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Kyle\" title=\"Kyle\">Kyle</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<table id=\"Stub\" class=\"noprint stub plainlinks\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><i>This article is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Stub\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:Stub\">stub</a>. You can help Potion Maker Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Travelers?action=edit&amp;useeditor=source\">expanding it</a>.</i>\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261013065610\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 33/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 771/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    3.450      1 -total\n 53.82%    1.857      1 Template:Stub\n 43.30%    1.494      1 Template:Navbox-characters\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_potionmaker783:pcache:idhash:2142-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261013065610 and revision id 5600. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
